OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officers hurt after patrol
OL,4,Acar rammed repeatedly
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police officers have been hurt and
OL,7,Ftwo men arrested after a car repeatedly
OL,8,Frammed a PSNI patrol car in west
OL,9,FBelfast.
OL,11,FThe incident happened just before
OL,12,Fmidnight on Tuesday, after the officers
OL,13,Fon patrol saw a silver Nissan Juke
OL,14,Fdriving at high speed on the Glen Road.
OL,16,FBoth officers have attended hospital
OL,17,Ffor treatment on Wednesday morning,
OL,18,Fpolice said.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
