OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officers hurt after patrol
OL,4,Acar rammed repeatedly
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the men arrested was a
OL,7,F39-year-old who is being held on a
OL,8,Fnumber of offences including driving
OL,9,Fwhile unfit through drink or drugs and
OL,10,Fpossession of a Class A controlled
OL,11,Fdrug.
